wrap\">\n<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-4ae5340 elementor-view-framed elementor-shape-circle elementor-position-top elementor-vertical-align-top elementor-widget elementor-widget-icon-box\" data-id=\"4ae5340\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"icon-box.default\">\n<div class=\"elementor-widget-container\">\n<div class=\"elementor-icon-box-wrapper\">\n<div class=\"elementor-icon-box-icon\"> <span class=\"elementor-icon elementor-animation-\"> <i aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"fas fa-compact-disc\"></i> </span></div><div class=\"elementor-icon-box-content\"> <h3 class=\"elementor-icon-box-title\"> <span>DJ Performances</span> </h3> <p class=\"elementor-icon-box-description\">From around the world, DJ\'s will amaze you with magical sounds of Electronic Music. Regardless what genre are you after, Broken Radio DJ\'s always deliver.</p></div></div></div></div><div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-d39d7f2 elementor-view-framed elementor-shape-circle elementor-position-top elementor-vertical-align-top elementor-widget elementor-widget-icon-box\" data-id=\"d39d7f2\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"icon-box.default\">\n<div class=\"elementor-widget-container\">\n<div class=\"elementor-icon-box-wrapper\">\n<div class=\"elementor-icon-box-icon\"> <span class=\"elementor-icon elementor-animation-\"> <i aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"fas fa-star-and-crescent\"></i> </span></div><div class=\"elementor-icon-box-content\"> <h3 class=\"elementor-icon-box-title\"> <span>Live Club Nights</span> </h3> <p class=\"elementor-icon-box-description\">We are working to bring you live audio/video streams from clubs around the world. Feel like you\'re on the other side of the planet, RAVING!</p></div></div></div></div></div></div></div></div></div></section></div></div></div></div></div></header>\n<section class=\"elementor-section elementor-top-section elementor-element elementor-element-9b4b1a7 elementor-section-boxed elementor-section-hei