875 0,-240.13299560546875 0,-240.13299560546875 C132.52940368652344,-240.13299560546875 240.13299560546875,-132.52940368652344 240.13299560546875,0z\"></path></g></g><g style=\"display: none;\"><path></path><g><path stroke-linecap=\"butt\" stroke-linejoin=\"miter\" fill-opacity=\"0\" stroke-miterlimit=\"4\"></path></g></g><g style=\"display: none;\"><path></path><g><path stroke-linecap=\"butt\" stroke-linejoin=\"miter\" fill-opacity=\"0\" stroke-miterlimit=\"4\"></path></g></g><g style=\"display: none;\"><path></path><g><path></path><path stroke-linecap=\"butt\" stroke-linejoin=\"miter\" fill-opacity=\"0\" stroke-miterlimit=\"4\"></path></g></g></g></g></g></g></g></g></g></svg></div></div></div></div></div></div></div><header class=\"elementor-column elementor-col-50 elementor-top-column elementor-element elementor-element-e8211c4\" data-id=\"e8211c4\" data-element_type=\"column\" data-settings=\"{\"background_background\":\"classic\"}\">\n<div class=\"elementor-column-wrap lazyelementorbackgroundimages elementor-element-populated\">\n<div class=\"elementor-widget-wrap\">\n<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-5e9e8e3 elementor-widget elementor-widget-heading\" data-id=\"5e9e8e3\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"heading.default\">\n<div class=\"elementor-widget-container\"> <h2 class=\"elementor-heading-title elementor-size-xl\">What is Broken Radio about?</h2></div></div><div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-2a85473 elementor-widget elementor-widget-text-editor\" data-id=\"2a85473\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"text-editor.default\">\n<div class=\"elementor-widget-container\">\n<div class=\"elementor-text-editor elementor-clearfix\"><p>Broken Radio is a not-for-profit project. It has been created to connect audience with amazing DJ’s and sounds from every corner of electronic music genres. A platform where the underground music has its own place to thrive.</p></div></div></div></div></div></header></div></div></section>\n<section class=\"elementor-section elementor-top-section elementor-element elementor-element-e72f9fe elementor-section-boxed elementor-section-height-default elementor-section-height-default elementor-invisible\" data-id=\"e72f9fe\" data-element_type=\"section\" data-settings=\"{\"background_background\":\"classic\",\"animation\":\"none\",\"animation_delay\":15}\">\n<div class=\"elementor-container elementor-column-gap-default\">\n<div class=\"elementor-row\">\n<div class=\"elementor-column elementor-col-33 elementor-top-column elementor-element elementor-element-55d8303 elementor-invisible\" data-id=\"55d8303\" data-element_type=\"column\" data-settings=\"{\"animation\":\"fadeIn\",\"animation_delay\":10,\"background_background\":\"classic\"}\">\n<div class=\"elementor-column-wrap lazyelementorbackgroundimages elementor-element-populated\">\n<div class=\"elementor-widget-wrap\">\n<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-efc032a elementor-widget elementor-widget-image\" data-id=\"efc032a\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"image.default\">\n<div class=\"elementor-widget-container\">\n<div class=\"elementor-image\"> <img width=\"800\" height=\"534\" src=\"./Broken Radio - Where Electronic Music has a place to thrive!_files/music-box-1419792_1920-1024x683.jpg\" alt=\"what kind of music you can listen on broken radio\" loading=\"lazy\" srcset=\"//d4c2v3v2.stackpathcdn.com/wp-content/uploads/2020/05/music-box-1419792_1920-1024x683.jpg 1024w, //d4c2v3v2.stackpathcdn.com/wp-content/uploads/2020/05/music-box-1419792_1920-300x200.jpg 300w, //d4c2v3v2.stackpathcdn.com/wp-content/uploads/2020/05/music-box-1419792_1920-768x512.jpg 768w, //d4c2v3v2.stackpathcdn.com/wp-content/uploads/2020/05/music-box-1419792_1920-1536x1024.jpg 1536w, //d4c2v3v2.stackpathcdn.com/wp-content/uploads/2020/05/music-box-1419792_1920-1200x800.jpg 1200w, //d4c2v3v2.stackpathcdn.com/wp-content/uploads/2020/05/music-box-1419792_1920.jpg 1920w\" sizes=\"(max-width: 800px) 100vw, 800px\" class=\"attachment-large size-large no-lazyload\"></div></div></div><div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-bb2ec07 elementor-widget elementor-widget-heading\" data-id=\"bb2ec07\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"heading.default\">\n<div class=\"elementor-widget-container\"> <h2 class=\"elementor-heading-title elementor-size-default\">What is Electronic Music?</h2></div></div><div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-0159fa7 elementor-widget elementor-widget-text-editor\" data-id=\"0159fa7\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"text-editor.default\">\n<div class=\"elementor-widget-container\">\n<div class=\"elementor-text-editor elementor-clearfix\"><p>Electronic music has a wide spectrum of genres. </p><p>From very bouncy and mainly dancefloor worthy like Techno, Drum and Bass, House, Trance (to name a few)  to sounds you enjoy predominately at home like ambient, new wave, chill out, trip hop.</p><p>Broken Radio will try to meet any expectations. Want to know more? Click <a href=\"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/List_of_electronic_music_genres\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">>HERE<</a></p></div></div></div></div></div></div><div class=\"elementor-column elementor-col-33 elementor-top-column elementor-element elementor-element-87fb5e8 elementor-invisible\" data-id=\"87fb5e8\" data-element_type=\"column\" data-settings=\"{\"animation\":\"fadeIn\",\"animation_delay\":10,\"background_background\":\"classic\"}\">\n<div class=\"elementor-column-wrap lazyelementorbackgroundimages elementor-element-populated\">\n<div class=\"elementor-widget-wrap\">\n<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-734f5d9 elementor-widget elementor-widget-heading\" data-id=\"734f5d9\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"heading.default\">\n<div class=\"elementor-widget-container\"> <h2 class=\"elementor-heading-title elementor-size-default\">How can you listen to us</h2></div></div><div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-ed34159 elementor-widget elementor-widget-text-editor\" data-id=\"ed34159\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"text-editor.default\">\n<div class=\"elementor-widget-container\">\n<div class=\"elementor-text-editor elementor-clearfix\"><p>Firstly, You can listen to Broken Radio on any device connected to the interwebz! However, for best experience, use modern browsers/devices.</p> <p>Secondly, if you do want to view live video Dj streams, use unlimited data connection, Broken Radio should be free, keep it that way!</p></div></div></div><div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-54ae3f7 elementor-widget elementor-widget-image\" data-id=\"54ae3f7\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"image.default\">\n<div class=\"elementor-widget-container\">\n<div class=\"elementor-image\"> <img onload=\"Wpfcll.r(this,true);\" src=\"./Broken Radio - Where Electronic Music has a place to thrive!_files/blank.gif\" width=\"800\" height=\"534\" data-wpfc-original-src=\"//d4c2v3v2.stackpathcdn.com/wp-content/uploads/2020/05/plug-1859843_1920-1024x683.jpg\" alt=\"what devices can be used to connect to broken radio\" loading=\"lazy\" data-wpfc-original-srcset=\"//d4c2v3v2.stackpathcdn.com/wp-content/uploads/2020/05/plug-1859843_1920-1024x683.jpg 1024w, //d4c2v3v2.stackpathcdn.com/wp-content/uploads/2020/05/plug-1859843_1920-300x200.jpg 300w, //d4c2v3v2.stackpathcdn.com/wp-content/uploads/2020/05/plug-1859843_1920-768x512.jpg 768w, //d4c2v3v2.stackpathcdn.com/wp-content/uploads/2020/05/plug-1859843_1920-1536x1024.jpg 1536w, //d4c2v3v2.stackpathcdn.com/wp-content/uploads/2020/05/plug-1859843_1920-1200x800.jpg 1200w, //d4c2v3v2.stackpathcdn.com/wp-content/uploads/2020/05/plug-1859843_1920.jpg 1920w\" sizes=\"(max-width: 800px) 100vw, 800px\" class=\"attachment-large size-large no-lazyload\"></div></div></div></div></div></div><div class=\"elementor-column elementor-col-33 elementor-top-column elementor-element elementor-element-9c89f8c elementor-invisible\" data-id=\"9c89f8c\" data-element_type=\"column\" data-settings=\"{\"animation\":\"fadeIn\",\"animation_delay\":10,\"background_background\":\"classic\"}\">\n<div class=\"elementor-column-wrap lazyelementorbackgroundimages elementor-element-populated\">\n<div class=\"elementor-widget-wrap\">\n<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-b625ab3 elementor-widget elementor-widget-image\" data-id=\"b625ab3\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"image.default\">\n<div class=\"elementor-widget-container\">\n<div class=\"elementor-image\"> <img onload=\"Wpfcll.r(this,true);\" src=\"./Broken Radio - Where Electronic Music has a place to thrive!_files/blank.gif\" data-wpfc-original-src=\"//d4c2v3v2.stackpathcdn.com/wp-content/uploads/elementor/thumbs/texture-3319946_1920-oqyjb5fd2t81nwv85bdc8fsottawi525ri2i7ojit6.jpg\" title=\"texture-3319946_1920\" alt=\"perpetual sound is always on broken radio\" class=\"no-lazyload\"></div></div></div><div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-9a2e2c0 elementor-widget elementor-widget-heading\" data-id=\"9a2e2c0\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"heading.default\">\n<div class=\"elementor-widget-container\"> <h2 class=\"elementor-heading-title elementor-size-default\">Perpetual sound!</h2></div></div><div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-b6a4058 elementor-widget elementor-widget-text-editor\" data-id=\"b6a4058\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"text-editor.default\">\n<div class=\"elementor-widget-container\">\n<div class=\"elementor-text-editor elementor-clearfix\"><p><b><u>Perpetual (adjective) – lasting an indefinitely long time:</u></b></p><p>Broken Radio is always online with 3 (sofar) 24/7 streams. Bare in mind those are not live, mostly pre recorded Broken DJ’s streams.</p><p>So, we have for you 3 streams: Techno Zone, Trance Zone and D’n’B Zone!</p><p>Fell free to abuse the connection!</p></div></div></div></div></div></div></div></div></section>\n<footer class=\"elementor-section elementor-top-section elementor-element elementor-element-52bc11b elementor-section-content-middle elementor-section-boxed elementor-section-height-default elementor-section-height-default\" data-id=\"52bc11b\" data-element_type=\"section\" data-settings=\"{\"background_background\":\"classic\"}\">\n<div class=\"elementor-container elementor-column-gap-default\">\n<div class=\"elementor-row\">\n<div class=\"elementor-column elementor-col-50 elementor-top-column elementor-element elementor-element-7a57106e\" data-id=\"7a57106e\" data-element_type=\"column\" data-settings=\"{\"background_background\":\"classic\"}\">\n<div class=\"elementor-column-wrap lazyelementorbackgroundimages elementor-element-populated\">\n<div class=\"elementor-widget-wrap\">\n<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-4a678b6 elementor-widget elementor-widget-heading\" data-id=\"4a678b6\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"heading.default\">\n<div class=\"elementor-widget-container\"> <h2 class=\"elementor-heading-title elementor-size-default\">Social Links:</h2></div></div><div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-30299a3d elementor-shape-circle elementor-grid-0 elementor-widget elementor-widget-social-icons\" data-id=\"30299a3d\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"social-icons.default\">\n<div class=\"elementor-widget-container\">\n<div class=\"elementor-social-icons-wrapper elementor-grid\">\n<div class=\"elementor-grid-item\"> <a class=\"elementor-icon elementor-social-icon elementor-social-icon-facebook-f elementor-repeater-item-4cd9d92\" href=\"https://www.facebook.com/groups/brokendotradio\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\"> <span class=\"elementor-screen-only\">Facebook-f</span> <i class=\"fab fa-facebook-f\"></i> </a></div><div class=\"elementor-grid-item\"> <a class=\"elementor-icon elementor-social-icon elementor-social-icon-mixcloud elementor-repeater-item-b582169\" href=\"https://www.mixcloud.com/brokendotradio\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\"> <span class=\"elementor-screen-only\">Mixcloud</span> <i class=\"fab fa-mixcloud\"></i> </a></div><div class=\"elementor-grid-item\"> <a class=\"elementor-icon elementor-social-icon elementor-social-icon-twitter elementor-repeater-item-8340608\" href=\"https://twitter.com/brokenDOTradio\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\"> <span class=\"elementor-screen-only\">Twitter</span> <i class=\"fab fa-twitter\"></i> </a></div></div></div></div><div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-12c5085d elementor-widget elementor-widget-heading\" data-id=\"12c5085d\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"heading.default\">\n<div class=\"elementor-widget-container\"> <h4 class=\"elementor-heading-title elementor-size-default\">Special thanks to:</h4></div></div><div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-236cfebe elementor-widget elementor-widget-text-editor\" data-id=\"236cfebe\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"text-editor.default\">\n<div class=\"elementor-widget-container\">\n<div class=\"elementor-text-editor elementor-clearfix\"><p>Broken Platform wouldn’t be possible without amazing Open Source Projects. <a href=\"https://www.kiwiirc.com/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">KiwiIRC</a> and <a href=\"https://www.azuracast.com/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">Azuracast</a> are our main players and we send them <3</p></div></div></div></div></div></div><div class=\"elementor-column elementor-col-50 elementor-top-column elementor-element elementor-element-98620b4\" data-id=\"98620b4\" data-element_type=\"column\">\n<div class=\"elementor-column-wrap lazyelementorbackgroundimages elementor-element-populated\">\n<div class=\"elementor-widget-wrap\">\n<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-3d6da5 elementor-testimonial--skin-bubble elementor-testimonial--layout-image_inline elementor-testimonial--align-center elementor-pagination-type-bullets elementor-widget elementor-widget-testimonial-carousel\" data-id=\"3d6da5\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-settings=\"{\"space_between\":{\"unit\":\"px\",\"size\":0,\"sizes\":[]},\"speed\":1000,\"pagination\":\"bullets\",\"autoplay\":\"yes\",\"autoplay_speed\":5000,\"loop\":\"yes\",\"pause_on_interaction\":\"yes\",\"space_between_tablet\":{\"unit\":\"px\",\"size\":10,\"sizes\":[]},\"space_between_mobile\":{\"unit\":\"px\",\"size\":10,\"sizes\":[]}}\" data-widget_type=\"testimonial-carousel.default\">\n<div class=\"elementor-widget-container\">\n<div class=\"elementor-swiper\">\n<div class=\"elementor-main-swiper swiper-container swiper-container-initialized swiper-container-horizontal\" style=\"cursor: grab;\">\n<div class=\"swiper-wrapper\" style=\"transform: translate3d(-1470px, 0px, 0px); transition-duration: 0ms;\"><div class=\"swiper-slide swiper-slide-duplicate swiper-slide-duplicate-active\" data-swiper-slide-index=\"2\" style=\"width: 490px;\">\n<div class=\"elementor-testimonial\">\n<div class=\"elementor-testimonial__content\">\n<div class=\"elementor-testimonial__text\"> Some people think electronic music is cold, but I think that has more to do with the people listening than the actual music itself.</div></div><div class=\"elementor-testimonial__footer\"> <cite class=\"elementor-testimonial__cite\"><span class=\"elementor-testimonial__name\">Imogen Heap</span><span class=\"elementor-testimonial__title\">we are not sure actually do we know this person</span></cite></div></div></div>\n<div class=\"swiper-slide swiper-slide-duplicate-next\" data-swiper-slide-index=\"0\" style=\"width: 490px;\">\n<div class=\"elementor-testimonial\">\n<div class=\"elementor-testimonial__content\">\n<div class=\"elementor-testimonial__text\"> If Pac-Man had affected us as kids, we’d all be running around in dark rooms, munching pills and listening to repetitive electronic music.</div></div><div class=\"elementor-testimonial__footer\">\n<div class=\"elementor-testimonial__image\"> <img onload=\"Wpfcll.r(this,true);\" src=\"./Broken Radio - Where Electronic Music has a place to thrive!_files/blank.gif\" data-wpfc-original-src=\"//d4c2v3v2.stackpathcdn.com/wp-content/uploads/2020/05/favicon-1.png\" alt=\"Marcus Brigstocke\" class=\"no-lazyload\"></div><cite class=\"elementor-testimonial__cite\"><span class=\"elementor-testimonial__name\">Marcus Brigstocke</span><span class=\"elementor-testimonial__title\">Someone we don\'t actually know</span></cite></div></div></div><div class=\"swiper-slide swiper-slide-prev\" data-swiper-slide-index=\"1\" style=\"width: 490px;\">\n<div class=\"elementor-testimonial\">\n<div class=\"elementor-testimonial__content\">\n<div class=\"elementor-testimonial__text\"> For me, electronic music is the classical music of the 21st century.</div></div><div class=\"elementor-testimonial__footer\"> <cite class=\"elementor-testimonial__cite\"><span class=\"elementor-testimonial__name\">Jean-Michel Jarre</span><span class=\"elementor-testimonial__title\">Someone we actually know 😀</span></cite></div></div></div><div class=\"swiper-slide swiper-slide-active\" data-swiper-slide-index=\"2\" style=\"width: 490px;\">\n<div class=\"elementor-testimonial\">\n<div class=\"elementor-testimonial__content\">\n<div class=\"elementor-testimonial__text\"> Some people think electronic music is cold, but I think that has more to do with the people listening than the actual music itself.</div></div><div class=\"elementor-testimonial__footer\"> <cite class=\"elementor-testimonial__cite\"><span class=\"elementor-testimonial__name\">Imogen Heap</span><span class=\"elementor-testimonial__title\">we are not sure actually do we know this person</span></cite></div></div></div><div class=\"swiper-slide swiper-slide-duplicate swiper-slide-next\" data-swiper-slide-index=\"0\" style=\"width: 490px;\">\n<div class=\"elementor-testimonial\">\n<div class=\"elementor-testimonial__content\">\n<div class=\"elementor-testimonial__text\"> If Pac-Man had affected us as kids, we’d all be running around in dark roo