(600063, '<div style=\"font-family: courier; color: #fff; margin: 20px;text-align: justify;\">\ntake care what you sign up for<br>\ntake care what you offer to others<br>\ntake care what you let them take from you<br>for they will take it all<br>drowning people will pull you under to save themselves<br>and rudeness is commonly found where courtesy would make sense<br>at the end of the day, no good deed goes unpunished<br>so beware and be generous, but only to those who appreciate it</div><div style=\"font-family: courier; color: #fff; margin: 20px;text-align: justify;\"><br>the biggest fool is the one who assumes benevolence is somehow required<br>takes it for granted<br>then insults their benefactors</div>', '2022-06-19 20:49:48', 145, 61, 'whitehot robot', 'take care', '', 0, 0, ''),
(600065, '<div style=\"font-family: courier;margin: 20px; text-align: justify;color: #fff;\">There are people who do not hesitate to arrange to get their wishes, no matter whose metaphorical flesh is cut by their designs, as long as they feel no one will discover their influence. People who lack moral compasses, who see ends as justifying means regardless of ethical constraints, should never be rewarded for their deception.</div><div style=\"font-family: courier;margin: 20px; text-align: justify;color: #fff;\">It is the responsibility of victims to resist, defy, and deny such people any reward for their nonconsensual, manipulative theft of choices. To condone such action is a disservice to the victim him or herself, as well as the next.</div><div style=\"font-family: courier;margin: 20px; text-align: justify;color: #fff;\">In this vein, when a person or persons endeavor to destroy a marriage or family for any covert, unofficial purposes, they have committed a crime, and the appropriate response of the victims is to refuse to cooperate with any further action. Usually that means refusing to accept an arranged marriage, or the unwanted separation itself, at least.</div><div style=\"font-family: courier;margin: 20px; text-align: justify;color: #fff;\">Participation in romance involving sexual intimacy and family bonding is among the most personal of choices anyone can make. The individual MUST ALWAYS HAVE the choice to propose, agree to, and renegotiate when necessary, the agreement for intimacy. Anything else is some degree of rape and is a crime.</div>', '2022-06-23 04:42:39', 145, 61, 'whitehot robot', 'coersion and duressed choices', '', 0, 0, '#survival'),
(600066, '<div style=\"margin: 20px; font-family: courier;color: #fff;text-align: center;\"><br>the evolution of consent</div><div style=\"margin: 20px; font-family: courier;color: #fff;text-align: justify;\">The question of propriety surrounding sex is answered succinctly with a proper, all-encompassing definition of consent.<br></div><div style=\"margin: 20px; font-family: courier;color: #fff;text-align: justify;\">\nConsent has always been at least a 4 (four) part device, being incomplete without any of the following:</div><div style=\"margin: 20px; font-family: courier;color: #fff;text-align: justify;\">1) Wherewithal - understanding of the proposal and its central, long-term effects</div><div style=\"margin: 20px; font-family: courier;color: #fff;text-align: justify;\">2) Demonstrable consciousness</div><div style=\"margin: 20px; font-family: courier;color: #fff;text-align: justify;\">3) For written agreements, brevity of contract. The proposal must be complete, but easily understood/understandable</div><div style=\"margin: 20px; font-family: courier;color: #fff;text-align: justify;\">4) The consent itself, which may be express or implied, but must exist</div><div style=\"margin: 20px; font-family: courier;color: #fff;text-align: justify;\">\nUnfortunately, these alone still present edge cases where group consent may be invoked, whereby a person must accept sexual acquiescence along with group membership. The folly here is that consent is undermined by the conflation of member privileges or benefits, and even the potential for benefits invalidates the consent by way of coercion.</div><div style=\"margin: 20px; font-family: courier;color: #fff;text-align: justify;\">In consideration of this, a 5th requirement is patently necessary.<br>\n</div><div style=\"margin: 20px; font-family: courier;color: #fff;text-align: justify;\">5) All considerations factoring into consent must be undivided, involving only the INDIVIDUALS in question.</div><div style=\"margin: 20px; font-family: courier;color: #fff;text-align: center;\"><br></div><div style=\"margin: 20px; font-family: courier;color: #fff;text-align: center;\">-end-</div><div style=\"margin: 20px; font-family: courier;color: #fff;text-align: center;\"><br></div>', '2022-06-25 03:53:36', 145, 60, 'whitehot robot', 'the evolution of consent', '', 0, 0, '#morality #sexuality #psychology'),
(600067, '<a href=\"https://www.sharedrop.io/rooms/d9e21554-0b60-474d-93c5-0331576d4377\">https://www.sharedrop.io/rooms/d9e21554-0b60-474d-93c5-0331576d4377</a>', '2022-06-26 18:37:15', 145, 11, 'whitehot robot', '', '', 1, 0, ''),
(600068, '<div style=\"font-family: courier; font-size: 16px;color: #fff;margin:20px;text-align: justify;\">So much is taken for granted by modern composers, inventors, and everyone who benefits from the centuries of backbreaking research that is the foundation of modern practice. For example, if tasked with building a cell phone or even a bicycle from scratch (financial barriers notwithstanding), most people would be at a loss, which should call into question their entitlement to use these things. Do not aspects of judgement, understanding, and responsibility normally accompany the wherewithal to invent things, and can we assume that end users need never have them? ...</div><div style=\"font-family: courier; font-size: 16px;color: #fff;margin:20px;text-align: justify;\">Seemingly innocuous, the technology of music theory, its structure and capacity for creating emotions and conveying ideas, is among the most subtly powerful and potentially dangerous of technologies. But before this text is mistaken as a vote for censorship, the subject here is specifically the chords, intervals, and progressions of the Western Scale.</div><div style=\"font-family: courier; font-size: 16px;color: #fff;margin:20px;text-align: justify;\">The persons involved in the design of the 12-note scale used by virtually all Western (not Asian or middle Eastern) music, are not relevant, nor necessarily known. Much of our \"history\" is fabricated to suit those in power at the time of its writing and is therefore unreliable and often inaccurate. But this 12-note design (C, C#/D♭, D, D#/E♭, E, F, F#/G♭, G, G#/A♭, A, A#, B♭, B), contains the frequencies which resonate in the human brain as basic warmth, light &amp; happiness, or cooler sadness &amp; darkness. These flavors are called major and minor chords, respectively.</div><div style=\"font-family: courier; font-size: 16px;color: #fff;margin:20px;text-align: justify;\">Without getting too technical (this is not a technical paper), the nature of a chord and its emotional charge is inverted by the placement of the 3rd interval, major if placed 4 steps above the key, or minor if \"diminished\", placed 3 steps above the key. Of course, traditional music typically involves not just one chord, but \"chord progressions\" which may involve major and minor scales, but for a given position in a song, the scale determines the feeling, warm or cool, at that place. The amazing thing is how these intervals were discovered and implemented for every orchestral instrument (save certain percussion instruments) uniformly and so effectively.</div><div style=\"font-family: courier; font-size: 16px;color: #fff;margin:20px;text-align: justify;\">With respect to all the various embellishments, improvisations, and clever adaptations by augmenting or diminishing various notes, the emotional character of a piece all hinges on the third interval, without which (and often it is absent intentionally), the listener remains unsure of the song\'s disposition, fortuitous or foreboding.<br>\n</div>', '2022-07-13 15:40:17', 145, 58, 'whitehot robot', 'music as a vehicle for emotions', '', 0, 0, '#music #theory'),
(600069, '<br><span style=\"color: rgb(255, 255, 255); font-family: CoinbaseSans, -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, &quot;Segoe UI&quot;, Roboto, Oxygen, Ubuntu, Cantarell, &quot;Fira Sans&quot;, &quot;Droid Sans&quot;, &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, sans-serif; text-align: start;\">tz1QtMB5aGPmLEwy8nqaV7ee6zBwV7YTHoGh</span><br>', '2022-07-14 00:33:19', 145, 12, 'whitehot robot', 'xtz srmcgann coinbase advanced', '', 1, 0, ''),
(600070, '<br><font color=\"#ffffff\" face=\"CoinbaseSans, -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, Segoe UI, Roboto, Oxygen, Ubuntu, Cantarell, Fira Sans, Droid Sans, Helvetica Neue, sans-serif\">TZ1X6UVNQDFQMXNMMHPCESDKNPJBCUGIE1AQ</font><br>', '2022-07-14 00:35:38', 145, 12, 'whitehot robot', 'xtz payway.dweet coinbase advanced', '', 1, 0, ''),
(600071, '<div style=\"font-family: courier; color: #fff; margin: 20px; text-align: justify;font-size: 20px;line-height:1em;\"><center><br></center><center>Affirmative Action</center><center><br></center></div><div style=\"font-family: courier; color: #fff; margin: 20px; text-align: justify;font-size: 20px;line-height:1em;\">\nAffirmative action, the policies and laws for employment in many places aimed at combatting racial discrimination, more aptly called affirmative RE-action, is based on the assumption and expectation that racial discrimination is present and a factor in employment screening. This assumption is sometimes correct, and sometimes not, but a better approach to eliminate unfair discrimination would be implementation of a double-blind screening / testing process whereby applicants\' race could not be considered as a deciding factor.</div><div style=\"font-family: courier; color: #fff; margin: 20px; text-align: justify;font-size: 20px;line-height:1em;\">This approach differs in 2 critical ways from Affirmative Action, in that employers\' abilities to maintain a quality of staff is preserved, versus forcing them to employ someone of a particular race in order to fulfill a quota to the exclusion of a possibly better qualified candidate. Secondly, The only justification for Affirmative Action is the aforementioned assumption of racist hiring practices, which is as much discriminatory against employers as said practices would be of applicants.</div><div style=\"font-family: courier; color: #fff; margin: 20px; text-align: justify;font-size: 20px;line-height:1em;\">Ultimately, and invariably, reactions to problems like racial discrimination by way of laws, restrictions, penalties, and forced hiring of anyone, results in a loss of quality of personnel, stolen autonomy by policy makers from employers, a failure to serve the purpose of Affirmative Action itself (no employer can employ representatives from EVERY race), and, an enforcement against companies of being able to ensure their own best chances of success.</div><div style=\"font-family: courier; color: #fff; margin: 20px; text-align: justify;font-size: 20px;line-height:1em;\">With that said, racism, unfair discrimination (not all discrimination), and violation of EQUAL OPPORTUNITY are very real challenges for everyone. Hiring practices will never be completely fair, but this problem stems from, like many others, a broken economic system where everyone must \"coin up\" or die.</div><div style=\"font-family: courier; color: #fff; margin: 20px; text-align: justify;font-size: 20px;line-height:1em;\">Upon close examination, people are never equal, nor can they be. This reality must be acknowledged and form the basis of every expectation regarding employment and support for community members which may be less or un-qualified for work.<br>\n</div><div style=\"font-family: courier; color: #fff; margin: 20px; text-align: justify;font-size: 20px;line-height:1em;\"><center>end</center></div>', '2022-07-17 17:50:29', 145, 64, 'whitehot robot', 'Affirmative Action', '', 0, 0, '');
